WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.177
This query keeps every sale row.

00:00:02.177 --> 00:00:06.627
It also calculates the total revenue across all returned rows.

00:00:06.627 --> 00:00:12.377
Each sale amount is then divided by that total to calculate its contribution.

00:00:12.377 --> 00:00:16.637
The important point is that the detail row remains visible.

00:00:16.637 --> 00:00:22.318
We are adding context to the row, not replacing the detail with one grouped result.
